-- Row il-80. EXPECTED RED: three assertions that fail on purpose, one for I1 and two for I2. Each is about what the deposited pages print, and each is FALSE.
-- I1: no named instrument that the row read is printed with the word בטלה in a deposited text.
--     False: section 30 of the Commissions of Inquiry Law, as printed in SH 548, prints the name of the Ordinance named in paragraph (6) of section 13 with it. The Basic Law named in the same paragraph is typed as not checked and is outside the question.
-- I2, Red 1: the comparison table prints, between its row for old 68 and its row for old 69, a row whose old-section cell is 68א.
--     False: in the left-hand double column the row for old 68 is followed directly by the row for old 69.
-- I2, Red 2: the rows for old 55ב print 55ב in their new-section cells.
--     False: the new-section cells of those rows print 64, 65, 66 and 67.
-- The count, three, is declared in check.sh (expected_failed) and in encoding.json (expected_red). If a later instrument changes any of them, its assertion turns green and the declared count must go down with it.

§ `Expected red`

