#ASSERT `a row whose old-section cell is the cell is printed between two rows` `old 68` `old 69` "68א" `the rows of the left-hand double column, from old 57 to old 71`
#ASSERT `some row for the old section prints the words in its new-section cell` 55 "ב" "55ב" `the rows of the double column second from the left, from old 55alef to old 56`
